    {
      "id": "wDChjTeWNu91ZzeggX1w1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1527.3540839316508,
      "y": 2998.1055691757915,
      "width": 367.7197570800781,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1446919766,
      "version": 253,
      "versionNonce": 2136621718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784876487290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive on sync :\n\n1. Sync to be fast\n    - Polling with adaptive \n    freq. is great\n    - data sync to only fetch changed\n\n2. Sync to be consistent \n    - polling the DB or\n       event bus w/ cursor\n    \n    - Reconcilation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive on sync :\n\n1. Sync to be fast\n    - Polling with adaptive \n    freq. is great\n    - data sync to only fetch changed\n\n2. Sync to be consistent \n    - polling the DB or\n       event bus w/ cursor\n    \n    - Reconcilation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RMruKffbrQlsbsleLtGze",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1096.0560276996425,
      "y": 4426.767726119479,
      "width": 589.819580078125,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 361297220,
      "version": 344,
      "versionNonce": 1933699058,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785131234519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design Ticketmaster \n\nTicketmaster is an online platform that allows users \nto purchase tickets for concerts, sports, events and other \nlive entertainment. Has ~100M DAU \n\n\nFunctional Requirement :- \n\n- Book Tickets \n- View an event \n- Search for events \n  \n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Ticketmaster \n\nTicketmaster is an online platform that allows users \nto purchase tickets for concerts, sports, events and other \nlive entertainment. Has ~100M DAU \n\n\nFunctional Requirement :- \n\n- Book Tickets \n- View an event \n- Search for events \n  \n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Qots61PnHfihUupiTe3rp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1083.7140802983197,
      "y": 4768.295916786109,
      "width": 899.6392822265625,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 593559364,
      "version": 358,
      "versionNonce": 1263280942,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785142950621,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional Requirements :-\n- low\n- strong consistency for booking tickets and high availability for search and viewing events \n- read >> write \n- scalability to handle surges from popular events\n\n\n----------\nOut of scope :- \n- GDPR compliance \n- fault tolerance\n- etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirements :-\n- low\n- strong consistency for booking tickets and high availability for search and viewing events \n- read >> write \n- scalability to handle surges from popular events\n\n\n----------\nOut of scope :- \n- GDPR compliance \n- fault tolerance\n- etc.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uAJXypDJiOflhYk0Hwmq7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1068.1260496789737,
      "y": 5119.02660572139,
      "width": 150.79989624023438,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1673174194,
      "version": 74,
      "versionNonce": 670313906,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785131298443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Entities :-\n \n- Event \n- Venue\n- Performer\n- Ticket \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entities :-\n \n- Event \n- Venue\n- Performer\n- Ticket \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HfuFcdleCKUI2bQ4jsEVt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1051.6060733594231,
      "y": 5331.555375936122,
      "width": 941.2192993164062,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 252574446,
      "version": 527,
      "versionNonce": 1735032942,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785143831927,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API :- \n\n- GET /event/:eventId -> Event & Venue & Performer & Ticket[]\n\n- GET /search?term={term}&location={location}&type={type}&date={date} -> Partial<Event>[]\n\n- POST /booking/reserve\n  header: JWT | sessionToken\n  body: {\n    ticketId\n }\n\n- PUT /booking/confirm\n  header: JWT | sessionToken\n   body: {\n    ticketId,\n    paymentDetails (stripe) \n }\n   \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API :- \n\n- GET /event/:eventId -> Event & Venue & Performer & Ticket[]\n\n- GET /search?term={term}&location={location}&type={type}&date={date} -> Partial<Event>[]\n\n- POST /booking/reserve\n  header: JWT | sessionToken\n  body: {\n    ticketId\n }\n\n- PUT /booking/confirm\n  header: JWT | sessionToken\n   body: {\n    ticketId,\n    paymentDetails (stripe) \n }\n   \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
